OL,3,GNEWSAAberfan falls silent to mark 60
OL,4,Ayears since coal tip collapsed on
OL,5,Aschool and homes, killing 116 children
OL,6,Aand 28 adults
OL,7,
OL,8,FIt was said to be the late Queen
OL,9,FElizabeth's biggest regret that she
OL,10,Fdidn't visit until eight days after the
OL,11,Fdisaster - she later returned to the
OL,12,Fvillage in Merthyr Tydfil county a
OL,13,Ffurther three times
